{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "c1815df0-b2e8-578b-b0ef-c5dc3cbfaca1",
  "Description": "A rope of 24 links from a line of points, hung by its first link.\n\nOne [RigidBody] makes a link per point of [LinePoints]. A [RigidJoint] in Chain mode joins each link to the next, and a second one in World mode with InstanceIndex 0 pins the first link where it starts.\n\nAKA: rope, chain, pendulum, string, cable\n\nTips\n- CollisionGroup 1 on the links keeps neighbours from pushing each other apart.\n- Raise Substeps on [PhysicsWorld] if a long rope stretches.\n- Set InstanceIndex to a large number to pin the last link instead, or add a third joint to pin both ends.",
